    "text": "对下列实函数求导。已知 $x, y \\in (0, \\infty)$，$\\alpha$ 为正常数。\n\na) 求函数 $f(x) = (\\alpha + \\sqrt{x})^2$ 的二阶导数 $f''(x)$。\n\nb) 求函数 $f(x,y) = \\frac{\\log_\\alpha(\\alpha + x)}{\\alpha + y}$ 的所有二阶偏导数 $f_{xx}, f_{yy}, f_{xy}$。",
    "knowledge_points": [
      "基本求导法则",
      "链式法则",
      "幂函数求导",
      "对数函数求导",
      "二阶导数",
      "偏导数",
      "混合偏导数"
    ],
    "question_type": "求导与偏导数",
    "method": [
      "链式法则求导",
      "幂律求导",
      "对数求导",
      "偏导数计算"
    ],
    "solution_steps": [
      "对a)使用链式法则和幂函数求导法则",
      "对a)再求一次导",
      "对b)分别对x和y求偏导",
      "化简结果"
    ],
    "math_structure": {
      "type": "derivative_problem",
      "template": "给定 $f(x) = (\\alpha + g(x))^m$ 和 $h(x,y) = \\frac{p(x)}{q(y)}$，求 $f''(x)$ 和 $h$ 的二阶偏导数",
      "variable_count": 3
    },
    "difficulty": 2,
    "answer": [
      {
        "label": "a) 二阶导数",
        "steps": [
          "令 $u = \\alpha + \\sqrt{x}$，则 $f(x) = u^2$",
          "由链式法则：$f'(x) = 2u \\cdot u' = 2(\\alpha + \\sqrt{x}) \\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} = \\frac{\\alpha + \\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x}}$",
          "改写：$f'(x) = \\frac{\\alpha}{\\sqrt{x}} + 1 = \\alpha x^{-1/2} + 1$",
          "再求导：$f''(x) = \\alpha \\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) x^{-3/2} = -\\frac{\\alpha}{2x^{3/2}}$",
          "最终答案：$f''(x) = -\\frac{\\alpha}{2x^{3/2}}$ 或 $f''(x) = -\\frac{\\alpha}{2\\sqrt{x^3}}$"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "b) 二阶偏导数",
        "steps": [
          "对x求偏导：$f_x = \\frac{1}{\\alpha + y} \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}\\log_\\alpha(\\alpha + x) = \\frac{1}{\\alpha + y} \\cdot \\frac{1}{(\\alpha + x)\\ln \\alpha}$",
          "对y求偏导：$f_y = \\log_\\alpha(\\alpha + x) \\cdot \\frac{d}{dy}\\frac{1}{\\alpha + y} = -\\frac{\\log_\\alpha(\\alpha + x)}{(\\alpha + y)^2}$",
          "求 $f_{xx}$：$f_{xx} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\left[\\frac{1}{(\\alpha + y)(\\alpha + x)\\ln \\alpha}\\right] = -\\frac{1}{(\\alpha + y)(\\alpha + x)^2\\ln \\alpha}$",
          "求 $f_{yy}$：$f_{yy} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left[-\\frac{\\log_\\alpha(\\alpha + x)}{(\\alpha + y)^2}\\right] = \\frac{2\\log_\\alpha(\\alpha + x)}{(\\alpha + y)^3}$",
          "求 $f_{xy}$：$f_{xy} = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left[\\frac{1}{(\\alpha + y)(\\alpha + x)\\ln \\alpha}\\right] = -\\frac{1}{(\\alpha + y)^2(\\alpha + x)\\ln \\alpha}$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "practice_questions": [
      {
        "text": "对函数 $f(x) = (\\beta + \\sqrt[3]{x})^2$ 求二阶导数，其中 $\\beta > 0$ 为常数。",
